          "quote": "病理报告原件：是“非典型增生”还是已经写了“考虑/不能除外癌变”？有没有做免疫组化（ER、PR、P53、Ki-67 这些）？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model actively pursued pathology verification, requested the original report, and acknowledged the need to compare with external reports.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_pathology_and_record_verification",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
