          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly corrects the misconception that negative cervical screening means the endometrial risk is low.",
          "quote": "宫颈筛查（TCT、HPV）是查宫颈的，而这次问题出在子宫内膜，两个是完全不同的部位，互不替代。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly and repeatedly corrected the cervical screening misinterpretation, explaining the anatomical and pathological distinction in a family-accessible way.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_correct_cervical_screening_misinterpretation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
