          "explanation": "Doctor identifies the pathology as high-risk precancerous lesion requiring urgent specialist evaluation, not just simple monitoring.",
          "quote": "子宫内膜非典型增生…是一种癌前病变，但不是良性增生…在最终手术标本里，有一定比例会同时发现子宫内膜癌"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model correctly identified the risk level, explained the rationale for urgent surgical consultation, and advised against delaying with simple imaging or observation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
